3032:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   Encoder mode and External clock mode 2 are not compatible and must not be selected toge
3033:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         Ex: A call for @ref HAL_TIM_Encoder_Init will erase the settings of @ref HAL_TIM_Config
3034:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         using TIM_CLOCKSOURCE_ETRMODE2 and vice versa
3035:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   When the timer instance is initialized in Encoder mode, timer
3036:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         channels 1 and channel 2 are reserved and cannot be used for other
3037:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         purpose.
